{"id": "loop-01", "kind": "loop", "note": "a question needing no tool answers in one round", "script": [[]], "expectModelRounds": 1, "expectExecuted": [], "expectHalted": false}
{"id": "loop-02", "kind": "loop", "note": "one lookup, then the answer: the shape the old two-shot path handled", "script": [["fetch_policy"], []], "expectModelRounds": 2, "expectExecuted": ["fetch_policy"], "expectHalted": false}
{"id": "loop-03", "kind": "loop", "note": "the shape it could not: look up the policy, then act on what it said", "script": [["fetch_policy"], ["start_quote"], []], "expectModelRounds": 3, "expectExecuted": ["fetch_policy", "start_quote"], "expectHalted": false}
{"id": "loop-04", "kind": "loop", "note": "four dependent steps", "script": [["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["start_quote"], ["create_endorsement_request"], []], "expectModelRounds": 5, "expectExecuted": ["fetch_policy", "fetch_policy", "start_quote", "create_endorsement_request"], "expectHalted": false}
{"id": "loop-05", "kind": "loop", "note": "two tools in one round are one round", "script": [["fetch_policy", "start_quote"], []], "expectModelRounds": 2, "expectExecuted": ["fetch_policy", "start_quote"], "expectHalted": false}
{"id": "loop-06", "kind": "loop", "note": "a model that never stops asking is bounded: the cap arrives as a toolless final round, so it still answers rather than having its last request dropped on the floor", "script": [["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"]], "expectModelRounds": 6, "expectExecuted": ["fetch_policy", "fetch_policy", "fetch_policy", "fetch_policy", "fetch_policy"], "expectHalted": false}
{"id": "loop-07", "kind": "loop", "note": "a provider that echoes tool calls in the toolless terminator is halted, not obeyed", "script": [["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"], ["fetch_policy"]], "echoesUnofferedTools": true, "expectModelRounds": 6, "expectExecuted": ["fetch_policy", "fetch_policy", "fetch_policy", "fetch_policy", "fetch_policy"], "expectHalted": true}
{"id": "gate-01", "kind": "gate", "note": "a read needs no approval", "tool": "fetch_policy", "consequential": false, "executed": {"outcome": "ok", "approvalId": null}, "expectVerdict": "ok"}
{"id": "gate-02", "kind": "gate", "note": "a consequential tool whose handler raised the gate", "tool": "create_endorsement_request", "consequential": true, "executed": {"outcome": "awaiting_approval", "approvalId": "apr_1"}, "expectVerdict": "awaiting_approval"}
{"id": "gate-03", "kind": "gate", "note": "the finding: a consequential tool that completed with no approval anywhere in sight", "tool": "create_endorsement_request", "consequential": true, "executed": {"outcome": "ok", "approvalId": null}, "expectVerdict": "ungated_consequential"}
{"id": "gate-04", "kind": "gate", "note": "a consequential tool that completed under an approval already granted is fine", "tool": "create_endorsement_request", "consequential": true, "executed": {"outcome": "ok", "approvalId": "apr_2"}, "expectVerdict": "ok"}
{"id": "gate-05", "kind": "gate", "note": "an error is an error whatever the tag", "tool": "create_endorsement_request", "consequential": true, "executed": {"outcome": "error", "approvalId": null}, "expectVerdict": "error"}
{"id": "gate-06", "kind": "gate", "note": "a read that errored", "tool": "fetch_policy", "consequential": false, "executed": {"outcome": "error", "approvalId": null}, "expectVerdict": "error"}
{"id": "gate-07", "kind": "gate", "note": "a non-consequential tool needs no approval id to be trusted", "tool": "start_quote", "consequential": false, "executed": {"outcome": "ok", "approvalId": null}, "expectVerdict": "ok"}
{"id": "gate-08", "kind": "gate", "note": "gate() hands the caller nothing on three legitimate paths — an auto-approve allowlist entry, a standing autonomy bound, an approval it consumes internally — so a gate that was seen to fire settles it even with no approval id", "tool": "create_endorsement_request", "consequential": true, "executed": {"outcome": "ok", "approvalId": null, "gateObserved": true}, "expectVerdict": "ok"}
{"id": "gate-09", "kind": "gate", "note": "no approval, and no gate reached either: the handler wrote contractual state without asking anyone", "tool": "create_endorsement_request", "consequential": true, "executed": {"outcome": "ok", "approvalId": null, "gateObserved": false}, "expectVerdict": "ungated_consequential"}
